    "  name    - the label the player will show and filter by",
    "  family  - the coarse bucket (also selectable in the player)",
    "  parent  - optional finer hierarchy (used to group the picker)",
    "  aliases - other spellings, misspellings and abbreviations seen in the wild",
    "",
    "After editing run:  python3 step3_vocabulary.py --all   (check + load + coverage)"
